Source: libais
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Toby Schneider <toby@gobysoft.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               cmake
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/schwehr/libais
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/schwehr/libais

Package: libais1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: decoder for maritime AIS messages
 libais decodes the messages of the maritime Automatic Identification
 System (AIS), from NMEA sentences or their payloads.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libais-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libais1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: decoder for maritime AIS messages (development files)
 libais decodes the messages of the maritime Automatic Identification
 System (AIS), from NMEA sentences or their payloads.
 .
 This package contains the headers (ais.h, vdm.h) and the library to link
 against.
